Datafeed All available methods : sb2datafeedexport-altenar2.biahosted.com/api/DataFeedExport/GetEvents/ sb2datafeedexport-altenar2.biahosted.com/api/DataFeedExport/GetLiveEvents/ sb2datafeedexport-altenar2.biahosted.com/api/DataFeedExport/GetMarkets/ sb2datafeedexport-altenar2.biahosted.com/api/DataFeedExport/GetEventsMarkets/ sb2datafeedexport-altenar2.biahosted.com/api/DataFeedExport/GetEventDetails/ sb2datafeedexport-altenar2.biahosted.com/api/DataFeedExport/GetMarketTypes/ sb2datafeedexport-altenar2.biahosted.com/api/DataFeedExport/GetSports/ sb2datafeedexport-altenar2.biahosted.com/api/DataFeedExport/GetCategories/ sb2datafeedexport-altenar2.biahosted.com/api/DataFeedExport/GetChamps/    For example, if we want to find 1x2 market for Barcelona vs. Espanyol for skinid= Sportaza :  Step 1: We use the GetEvent method to get all the events for the date that we have set : https://sb2datafeedexport-altenar2.biahosted.com/api/DataFeedExport/GetEvents/XML?integration=librabet&langId=8&startDate=2021-11-20&endDate=2021-11-22  integration= librabet (the list of all available skinids for brands can be found below) langid= 8 (English for our example, the list of all available language IDs can be found below) startDate=YYYY-MM-DD (if not provided, current day’s date will be used) endDate=YYYY-MM-DD (if not provided, current day’s date +1 will be used)  Using this link and get event method, I find the event Barcelona vs. Espanyol and get the eventID :    Step 2 : We use the GetMarkets method to get all available markets for event Barcelona vs. Espanyol :  https://sb2datafeedexport-altenar2.biahosted.com/api/DataFeedExport/GetMarkets/XML?integration=librabet&langId=8&eventId=5018582     Sport IDs :   
